a crude spear to attack. May pose unexpected difficulties if fighting at close range.","abilities":["Gains DEF when blocked."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":2600,"atk":290,"def":60,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"roar_knightclub_trainee":{"slug":"roar_knightclub_trainee","name":"Roar Knightclub Trainee","icon":"/enemies-icons/Roar Knightclub Trainee.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Wearing the high-performance, lightweight armor provided by Roar Guards, this new batch of experimental armor has some humorous deficiencies that made these people into pitiful test subjects. 'Roar Guards, even the winds will bow to you!'","abilities":["Has significantly increased DEF and RES for a period of time"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":2800,"atk":300,"def":100,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.4}},"guerrilla_herald":{"slug":"guerrilla_herald","name":"Guerrilla Herald","icon":"/enemies-icons/Guerrilla Herald.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Patriot's guerilla fighters employ a special language to communicate and synergize their coordinated operations on the battlefield. The heralds are important links within their communication system. While present, they will issue tactical commands to increase the offensive and defensive abilities of nearby allies.","abilities":["Increases the ATK and DEF of enemy units when on the battlefield."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":300,"def":120,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.7}},"defense_crusher":{"slug":"defense_crusher","name":"Defense Crusher","icon":"/enemies-icons/Defense Crusher.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Reunion's senior elites, clad in a heavy blast suit. Each swing from their weapon is slow but packs tremendous destructive power. Operators will be stunned after taking several attacks.Proceed with caution.","abilities":["After two attacks, the next attack Stuns its target"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":1000,"def":1000,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"tiacauh_shredder":{"slug":"tiacauh_shredder","name":"Tiacauh Shredder","icon":"/enemies-icons/Tiacauh Shredder.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of Zumama's chosen elites, bestowed with excellent equipment. In addition to being potent in combat, they have the ability to destroy terrain in order to seize the advantage. Those who seek to use long-range attacks against them will have to diversify their tactics.","abilities":["After several attacks, destroys Giant Mushrooms and Stumps, rendering them unable to be deployed upon"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":650,"def":550,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"the_big_ugly_thing":{"slug":"the_big_ugly_thing","name":"'The Big Ugly Thing'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'The Big Ugly Thing'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Zumama's magnum opus, a massive mechanical monster piloted by the High Priest. It can strike both in melee range and from a distance, capable of easily destroying Giant Mushrooms and Stumps. Normal engineers cannot even fathom how a machine slapped together haphazardly like this can even move, but move it indeed does.","abilities":["First Form","Ranged attacks deal Splash damage, Melee attacks deal more damage","Periodically destroys Giant Mushrooms and Stumps, rendering them unable to be deployed upon","When HP drops to 0, it will explode, Stunning units in a large area and ejecting its pilot, the High Priest","High Priest Form","Will not attack, cannot be blocked, and takes True damage every second"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":500,"def":1000,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"corrupted_knight":{"slug":"corrupted_knight","name":"Corrupted Knight","icon":"/enemies-icons/Corrupted Knight.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Sarkaz knight with a broken horn who radiates terror and shows clear signs of excessive drug use. Uses a warhammer in battle. Crushes enemies with terrifying bloodlust. When the Withered Knight falls, takes up the quest and becomes dramatically stronger. Every step he takes spreads corruption.","abilities":["Attacks deal Physical damage to the target and adjacent allied units","Does charged attacks, dealing heavy Physical damage to the targets and any adjacent units","Gains greatly increased ATK, ASPD, and Movement Speed when <Withered Knight> dies"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.65,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":1200,"def":1200,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"faust":{"slug":"faust","name":"Faust","icon":"/enemies-icons/Faust.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Sniper who is one of Reunion's squad leaders, often working in tandem with Mephisto. He uses extremely long-range attacks to inflict devastating physical damage. He is known to occasionally use special attacks such as summoning turret-like ballistae or launching highly destructive bolts.","abilities":["Cannot be blocked and is initially Invulnerable for a period of time","Can attack with a special bolt dealing double damage","Periodically summons a hidden turret on the battlefield"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":37000,"atk":1000,"def":350,"res":35,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"patriot":{"slug":"patriot","name":"Patriot","icon":"/enemies-icons/Patriot.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"His armor is in disrepair and damaged in many places. The blade of his once sharp halberd is now eroded with rust. However, the indomitable Patriot never capitulates, never backs down, and never shows mercy. He has long struggled with fate, and now resolves to slit the throat of fate.","abilities":["Greatly increases the ATK and DEF of enemy units","Marching Stance","Gains greatly increased ATK, DEF, and RES. Becomes more likely to be targeted by your units, and normal attacks strike 4 times","Enters a revival state when HP drops to 0, continuously dealing True damage to units around him. After a period of time, enters Ruination stance","Ruination Stance","Can perform long-ranged attacks","Deals Physical damage to the farthest high ground unit","Continuously deals True damage to allied units within range","Immune to Stun, Frozen, and Levitate"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":45000,"atk":1600,"def":500,"res":45,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"withered_knight":{"slug":"withered_knight","name":"Withered Knight","icon":"/enemies-icons/Withered Knight.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],